
# Format: <type>(<scope>): <summary>
# Example: feat(rtl): add Hamming decoder
#
# Types: feat, fix, test, refactor, docs, build, chore, ci, perf, revert
# Scope: lowercase letters, digits, dot, slash, underscore, or hyphen
# Summary: 72 characters or fewer, with no trailing period
#
# Keep one purpose per commit. Add a body only when the reason is not obvious.
